<title>UK: Berlin Hannover Hypo sets bonds for 200 mln marks.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hannover Hypo sets bonds for 200 mln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berlin Hannover Hypothekenbank has launched two step-up bonds for 100 million marks each, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.6	 MATURITY   *24.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE  S-23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAN/BER   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 24.JUL.97, THEN STEPS UP TO 4.45 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 64</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY   *24.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE  S-23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAN/BER   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 24.JUL.97, THEN STEPS UP TO 4.35 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 65</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
